{%- doc -%}
  The white card in a reassurance row (Figma: Standart Product Page → Why Choose Us
  → Cards). A purple glyph, a title in the heading face and a line of copy, centred
  in a rounded panel.

  Sized by custom properties rather than by settings, the way [ui-icon-label] is, so
  the same card runs at the drawn 24px title three across and smaller four across
  without this snippet growing a variant for each. What a caller can move:
  `--ui-feature-card-padding-block`, `--ui-feature-card-padding-inline`,
  `--ui-feature-card-gap`, `--ui-feature-card-text-gap`, `--ui-feature-card-glyph`,
  `--ui-feature-card-title-size` and `--ui-feature-card-body-size`.

  The card fills the height of whatever cell it stands in, so a row of them lines up
  at the bottom without the caller measuring the longest one.

  The glyph is decorative: the title says the same thing, and a screen reader that
  reads both is being told everything twice.

  @param {string} [title] - The card's title.
  @param {string} [body] - The copy beneath it. Markup is printed as given, so a richtext setting can be passed straight through.
  @param {string} [icon] - The glyph, as an asset name or a readable one. Resolved by [ui-icon-name].
  @param {string} [tag] - Element for the title. Defaults to `h3`.
  @param {string} [class] - Additional CSS classes.
  @param {string} [attributes] - Additional attributes on the root.

  @example
  {% render 'ui-feature-card', icon: 'gift', title: 'Ready to Delight', body: '<p>Beautifully packaged.</p>' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- capture card_icon -%}{% render 'ui-icon-name', name: icon %}{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  assign title_tag = tag | default: 'h3'
-%}

<div class="ui-feature-card{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" {{ attributes }}>
  {%- if card_icon != blank -%}
    <span class="ui-feature-card__glyph" aria-hidden="true">{{- card_icon | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if title != blank or body != blank -%}
    <div class="ui-feature-card__text">
      {%- if title != blank -%}
        <{{ title_tag }} class="ui-feature-card__title">{{ title }}</{{ title_tag }}>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if body != blank -%}
        <div class="ui-feature-card__body">{{ body }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .ui-feature-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--ui-feature-card-gap, 32px);
    box-sizing: border-box;

    /* The card takes the cell, so a row lines up along the bottom without the
       caller measuring the longest one. */
    block-size: 100%;
    padding-block: var(--ui-feature-card-padding-block, 32px);
    padding-inline: var(--ui-feature-card-padding-inline, 24px);
    border-radius: var(--ui-feature-card-radius, 20px);
    background-color: var(--ui-feature-card-background, var(--ui-color-white));
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ui-feature-card__glyph {
    display: block;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    inline-size: var(--ui-feature-card-glyph, 24px);
    block-size: var(--ui-feature-card-glyph, 24px);
    /* The glyphs are drawn in the brand purple; the words under them are not. */
    color: var(--ui-feature-card-glyph-color, var(--ui-color-primary));
  }

  .ui-feature-card__glyph > svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ui-feature-card__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--ui-feature-card-text-gap, 16px);
    inline-size: 100%;
  }

  .ui-feature-card__title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ui-feature-card-title-color, var(--ui-color-black));
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: var(--ui-feature-card-title-size, 24px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .ui-feature-card__body {
    color: var(--ui-feature-card-body-color, var(--ui-color-gray));
    font-family: var(--ui-font-body);
    font-size: var(--ui-feature-card-body-size, 16px);
    font-weight: var(--ui-font-body-weight);
    line-height: var(--ui-line-height);
  }

  .ui-feature-card__body > * {
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* One line of copy between paragraphs, as [ui-text] spaces them. */
  .ui-feature-card__body > * + * {
    margin-block-start: calc(var(--ui-line-height, 1.3) * 1em);
  }

  .ui-feature-card__body a {
    color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
